Origin
------

Work on Sheep began on 2026-08-29 from a fork of an open-source, MIT-licensed
inference project. Every file that came from it was deleted and replaced during
development; PROVENANCE.md records the audit that checks the code in this
repository is original. The history published here starts after that point.

Sheep's engine (SML), its model format (SSF), the quantizer, the orchestrator,
the apps and the desktop interface are this project's own work.
